      "title": "Aleph Alpha Kolibri: How the sovereign German LLM works",
      "url": "https://tej.as/blog/aleph-alpha-kolibri",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49943034",
      "score": 407,
      "comments": 11,
      "author": "tejaskumar__",
      "published": "2026-10-03T10:43:51Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Aleph Alpha launched Kolibri, a sovereign European foundation model suite trained on EU infrastructure prioritizing GDPR and EU AI Act compliance.",
        "The architecture emphasizes multilingual performance across European languages, verifiable data lineage, and native explainability mechanisms for audited environments.",
        "Kolibri supports on-premise and sovereign cloud deployment, eliminating foreign jurisdictional risks and proprietary API dependency for regulated enterprises."
      ]
    },
