        "Lobsters' weekend threads highlight developer side projects, focusing on language experimentation, personal tooling, and soliciting technical peer review.",
        "Common engineer activities in recurring community check-ins include home lab maintenance, NixOS/Linux configuration, and self-hosted infrastructure testing.",
        "Community norms explicitly normalize complete detachment from coding over weekends to mitigate persistent burnout across technical teams."
      ]
